<!-- ═══════════ HEADER ═══════════ -->
<header class="header">
  <div class="header-content">
    <div class="venue">The Lancet Digital Health &mdash; AI in Clinical Medicine Symposium</div>
    <h1 class="title">Artificial Intelligence in Clinical Decision-Making</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">Performance, Safety, and Implementation Gaps</div>
    <p class="oneliner">A synthesis of current evidence on AI-assisted clinical decision support systems, highlighting diagnostic accuracy gains, safety considerations, and the translational gap from research to bedside deployment.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="header-accent"></div>
</header>

<!-- ═══════════ SECTION 1: BACKGROUND ═══════════ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-number teal">1</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Background &amp; Motivation</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="section-body">
    <div class="two-col">
      <div class="body-text">
        <p>The integration of <strong>artificial intelligence into clinical decision-making</strong> represents one of the most rapidly evolving frontiers in digital health. Machine-learning-based clinical decision support systems (CDSS) are increasingly evaluated across diagnostic, prognostic, and therapeutic domains.</p>
        <p>Despite promising results in controlled research settings, the <strong>translation of AI tools into routine clinical practice remains limited</strong>. Understanding the magnitude of this gap — and the factors driving it — is essential for researchers, clinicians, regulators, and health-system leaders.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="scope-item">
          <div class="scope-icon navy"><span>&#128202;</span></div>
          <div class="scope-text"><strong>400+</strong> published studies systematically reviewed</div>
        </div>
        <div class="scope-item">
          <div class="scope-icon teal"><span>&#9989;</span></div>
          <div class="scope-text"><strong>692</strong> FDA-cleared AI/ML medical devices (as of 2023)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="scope-item">
          <div class="scope-icon navy"><span>&#128300;</span></div>
          <div class="scope-text">Domains: <strong>Radiology, Dermatology, Ophthalmology, Pathology</strong></div>
        </div>
        <div class="scope-item">
          <div class="scope-icon teal"><span>&#9201;</span></div>
          <div class="scope-text"><strong>32%</strong> average reduction in diagnostic turnaround time</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════ SECTION 2: DIAGNOSTIC PERFORMANCE ═══════════ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-number teal">2</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Diagnostic Performance of AI Systems</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="section-body">
    <!-- Sensitivity Comparison -->
    <div class="compare-row">
      <div class="compare-side ai">
